|game_text=If your character is about to be hit, use 1 Force (free if by a [Permanent Weapon] weapon) to prevent its forfeit from being reduced (and character is immune to Dr. Evazan) for remainder of turn. OR Cancel Disarmed. [Immune to Sense.] OR Cancel a ‘react.’ OR During your move phase, target any or all of your characters at one site to ‘transport’ (relocate) to an exterior or battleground site. Draw destiny. Use that much Force to ‘transport,’ or place Interrupt in Lost Pile.
|sources=* [https://res.starwarsccg.org/cardlists/Set9Type.html Virtual Set 9 card list] at res.starwarsccg.org. Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20250925213245/https://res.starwarsccg.org/cardlists/Set9Type.html Internet Archive]
* [https://www.starwarsccg.org/resources/virtual-slips/ Virtual slips] at starwarsccg.org — Light: Odin Nesloor & •First Aid. Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20240920164229/https://www.starwarsccg.org/resources/virtual-slips/ Internet Archive]
* [https://scomp.starwarsccg.org/?s=Odin%20Nesloor%20%26%20%E2%80%A2First%20Aid Scomp Link Access] Card data [https://github.com/swccgpc/swccg-card-json/blob/d4e661ec/Light.json swccg-card-json Light.json] (commit d4e661ec). Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20261020174249/https://github.com/swccgpc/swccg-card-json/blob/d4e661ec/Light.json Internet Archive]
|rulings=* The destiny draw and cost are paid during initiation, and then responses (e.g. [[Sense]]) may take place.<ref name="scomp">[https://scomp.starwarsccg.org/?s=Odin%20Nesloor%20%26%20%E2%80%A2First%20Aid Scomp: Odin Nesloor & •First Aid]; card data [https://github.com/swccgpc/swccg-card-json/blob/d4e661ec/Light.json swccg-card-json Light.json] (commit d4e661ec). Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20261020174249/https://github.com/swccgpc/swccg-card-json/blob/d4e661ec/Light.json Internet Archive]</ref>
* If retargeted by [[Surprise]], it must EITHER select new characters to be transported OR select a new destination site.
* If using [[Surprise]] to choose new characters, the new characters may be at the same origin site or a different origin site, but it cannot include any of the original characters.
